<!doctype html><html lang="fr"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Connexion — Suicide Crew</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/style.css"></head><body><header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href="../index.html"><span class="brand-mark"><span>SC</span></span><span class="brand-copy"><strong>SUICIDE</strong><em>CREW</em><small>HONOR OF KINGS</small></span></a><nav class="main-nav"><a href="../index.html">Accueil</a><a href="equipe.html">La Team</a><a href="matchs.html">Matchs</a><a href="exploits.html">Exploits</a><a href="live.html">Live</a><a href="classement.html">Classement</a><a href="recrutement.html">Recrutement</a><a class="active" href="connexion.html">Connexion</a></nav></header><main class="subpage section-shell"><p class="eyebrow">06 / espace privé</p><h1 class="page-title">Connexion<br><em>membre.</em></h1><p class="page-intro">Cette interface est une démonstration. La connexion sécurisée sera branchée avec Django.</p><div class="standalone-form"><form class="page-form" data-demo-form><label>Pseudo ou e-mail<input required placeholder="overgamer@suicidecrew.gg"></label><label>Mot de passe<input required type="password" placeholder="••••••••"></label><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Se connecter <span>↗</span></button></form><p class="form-note">Pas encore membre ? <a href="recrutement.html">Envoyer une candidature</a></p></div></main><script src="../js/app.js"></script></body></html>